# Build products and per-run scratch. `work/` is NOT evidence: the tools are rebuilt
# by harness/build.sh, the carriers are recompiled by harness/baseline.py, and every
# capture's own inputs are hash-recorded in raw/<run>/00_inputs.json.
# The .bin files here are serialized Metal binary archives compiled from OUR OWN MSL
# (kernels/*.metal) -- they are build output, not evidence, and not Apple blobs.
bin/
baseline_bin/
run_*/
*.bin
*.log
pilot/*.bin
